      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>[icu] Fourth level collator strength value. When punctuation is ignored (see Ignoring Punctuation in the User Guide ) at PRIMARY to TERTIARY strength, an additional strength level can be used to distinguish words with and without punctuation. See class documentation for more explanation.</para>
